<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hackthebox on Askiesec</title><link>https://askiesec.blog/tags/hackthebox/</link><description>Recent content in Hackthebox on Askiesec</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://askiesec.blog/tags/hackthebox/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Facts - HackTheBox</title><link>https://askiesec.blog/writeups/facts-hackthebox/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://askiesec.blog/writeups/facts-hackthebox/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="recon"&gt;Recon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting with a full service scan:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#ebdbb2;background-color:#282828;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;nmap -vv --reason -sCV -T4 -oN outputs/nmap 10.129.19.102
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="E559948A-0A15-4AC5-A56C-D9DB341494C4.png" alt="alt text"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The scan revealed a web server. Based on the response headers and SSL certificate, I added &lt;code&gt;facts.htb&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;/etc/hosts&lt;/code&gt; and browsed to the site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="FDDCBA3A-6A94-4B7E-8624-9A19E33DC3D8.png" alt="alt text"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="web-enumeration"&gt;Web Enumeration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During manual fuzzing, a request to &lt;code&gt;/assets/themes/camaleon&lt;/code&gt; leaked the CMS being used:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#ebdbb2;background-color:#282828;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;GET /assets/themes/camaleon HTTP/1.1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Host: facts.htb
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="8FA6A7FA-F437-4A1E-A9A5-296322E06A3D.png" alt="alt text"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/owen2345/camaleon-cms"&gt;Camaleon CMS&lt;/a&gt; is a CMS built on Ruby on Rails. The admin panel is available at the default route: &lt;code&gt;http://facts.htb/admin/login&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>